      "content": "idk i feel like there is more to it than just ppl wanting to be entertained. like, if u actually look at the timing and the way the algorithm pushes it to certain groups of people... it feels less accidental. can u help me look at the subtext of it? like, if this WAS a psychological study on obedience, what kind of metrics or patterns would they be looking for in the way users interact with it?",
